{"questions":[{"question_id":"IbQp0czqZgb5XhpS","paperTitle":"JEE Advanced 2014 Paper 1 Offline","year":2014,"examDate":2014,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"d-and-f-block-elements","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","topic":"important-compounds-of-transition-elements","type":"mcqm","marks":3,"negMarks":0,"permalink":"upon-heating-with-cu2s-the-reagents-that-give-copper-meta-2014-marks-3-ibqp0czqzgb5xhps.htm","content":"Upon heating with Cu<sub>2</sub>S, the reagent(s) that give copper metal is/are","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"CuFeS<sub>2</sub>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"CuO"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Cu<sub>2</sub>O"},{"identifier":"D","content":"CuSO<sub>4</sub>"}],"correct_options":["B","C","D"],"explanation":"<p>To understand which of the given reagents will give copper metal upon heating with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.461ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2413.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1768.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, let's discuss each one based on their chemical reactions during the process:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Option A: CuFeS<sub>2</sub></strong></p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.137ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3596.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1332,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2081,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2547,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(646,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (Chalcopyrite) when heated with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.461ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2413.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1768.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, it can react to form copper metal as part of the copper extraction process. However, the direct reaction between <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.137ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3596.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1332,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2081,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2547,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(646,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.461ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2413.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1768.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is more involved and typically requires a series of steps, including smelting and conversion to get to the copper metal. Therefore, while <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.137ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3596.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1332,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2081,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2547,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(646,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is a source of copper, it's not directly because of its reaction with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.461ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2413.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1768.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, but through a complex metallurgical process.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Option B: CuO</strong></p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -4.407ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30.747ex\" height=\"9.946ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -2448 13590.1 4396.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtable\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,1300)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\" transform=\"translate(2833.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"undefined\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2192\" transform=\"translate(288,0)\"></use><svg width=\"358\" height=\"180\" x=\"0\" y=\"160\" viewBox=\"89.5 160 358 180\"><use data-c=\"2190\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2190\" transform=\"scale(0.88,1)\"></use></svg></g><g data-mml-node=\"mpadded\" transform=\"translate(0,683.2) scale(0.707)\"><g transform=\"translate(278,-200)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"></g></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4289.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4789.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6504.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7504.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(8504.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,-1698)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1714.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3092.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4093,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4593,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1311,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6307.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\" transform=\"translate(7363.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"undefined\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2192\" transform=\"translate(288,0)\"></use><svg width=\"358\" height=\"180\" x=\"0\" y=\"160\" viewBox=\"89.5 160 358 180\"><use data-c=\"2190\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2190\" transform=\"scale(0.88,1)\"></use></svg></g><g data-mml-node=\"mpadded\" transform=\"translate(0,683.2) scale(0.707)\"><g transform=\"translate(278,-200)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"></g></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(8819.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(9319.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10819.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(11819.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1367,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p><strong>Option C: Cu<sub>2</sub>O</strong></p>\n\n<p>Copper(I) oxide (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.727ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2531.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1768.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) can also react with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.461ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2413.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1768.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> to produce copper metal directly. The equation for this reaction is:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"29.688ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 13122.1 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1260,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2268.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3253.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4254,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(5014,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6022.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6945.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(8223.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(8723.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(9483.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10277.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(11277.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(11922.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(796,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Here, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.727ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2531.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1768.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> serves as the oxidizing agent, reducing <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.461ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2413.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1768.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> to copper metal, while itself being reduced to copper, and sulfur is oxidized to sulfur dioxide. This reaction is similar in principle to the reaction with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.74ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2095 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(760,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1332,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, but involves copper(I) oxide instead.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Option D: CuSO<sub>4</sub></strong></p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -8.635ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"34.734ex\" height=\"18.402ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -4316.7 15352.6 8133.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtable\" data-frame-styles=\"\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,3043)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1834,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2645,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\" transform=\"trans